@engineering

Purpose:
  Software engineering principles and practices.

Use this index before applying engineering standards.

Concepts:
  @engineering.solid
      Object oriented design principles.

  @engineering.dry
      Don't repeat yourself.

  @engineering.kiss
      Keep it simple.

  @engineering.yagni
      You aren't gonna need it.

  @engineering.composition-over-inheritance
      Prefer composition.

  @engineering.fail-fast
      Detect errors early.

  @engineering.separation-of-concerns
      Separate responsibilities.

  @engineering.dependency-inversion
      Depend on abstractions.

DecisionGuide:
  Need OOP guidance?
    → @engineering.solid

  Need simplicity?
    → @engineering.kiss

  Need to avoid duplication?
    → @engineering.dry

  Need to avoid over-engineering?
    → @engineering.yagni

  Need extensibility?
    → @engineering.composition-over-inheritance

  Need early error detection?
    → @engineering.fail-fast

  Need modular design?
    → @engineering.separation-of-concerns

  Need testability?
    → @engineering.dependency-inversion

RelatedReferences:
  @best-practices
  @architecture

State: +
